<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Every Retro Game has its own channel, like %{channel}. The players of the game talk there, find partners and see the latest results. The channel %{feed} shows the results of every game.",
    channel: "#hex-pong",
    feed: "#retro-games"
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_robot}>GameServ</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "The service %{service} keeps the game channels and sits in each one. It announces a match between two people played in the open, a personal best, and a win against the computer on hard, with a card that shows the score. Once a day it says how many matches the game had and who did best.",
    service: "GameServ"
  )}
</p>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_games", "A private match is not announced.")}
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "The result of a private match stays in the conversation of its two players."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_games",
      "Each player is announced at most once every five minutes in each game. Every match still counts in the rankings."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_joystick}>{dgettext("help_games", "The strip under the topic")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "The name of the game opens the page of the game, on top of the chat."
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Play opens the game in a new tab. Find a partner puts a card with one open seat in the channel, like the command %{command}. The first person who joins plays with you.",
    command: "/lfg"
  )}
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "When somebody is playing the game in the open, a last link opens the match to watch."
  )}
</p>

<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lock}>{dgettext("help_games", "Who can")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_games",
    "Anybody can read a game channel and its page without an account. Playing, offering a seat, challenging somebody and talking need a registered nickname that you have identified. A visitor who presses any of them sees the sign-in window."
  )}
</p>

<p>
  {dgettext("help_games", "See also:")}
  <.help_link topic="feature-game-scores">
    {dgettext("help_games", "Scores and Rankings")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-game-watch">{dgettext("help_games", "Watching a Match")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-lfg">/lfg</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-challenge">/challenge</.help_link>
</p>
